{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play it your way, each hero has 3 different card categories, attack, defense, and utility. You can put together the combinations that best suit your play style.<br><br>Each category also has its own relics, which can further enhance your gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Rune System</h2>Enhance your deck with an advanced rune system that adds unique talents to your cards. This allows the deck construction to have endless possibilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Corruption</h2>The world is in a constant fight against corruption, which grows stronger as the days go by and applies disease to your world. These diseases directly interfere with combat and game difficulty, since the number of diseases increases with each full moon (7 days).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day &amp; Night Cycle</h2>Create strategies and prepare for the night in the midst of battle. At dusk, monsters of the night appear and black portals are opened. Get exclusive rewards if you win a night battle! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" width=616 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather Events</h2>Rains, sandstorms, blizzards. Some events can benefit you, but others can end your battle, be aware and use them to your advantage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" width=616 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>150+ Cards<br></li><li>70+ Relics<br></li><li>30+ Runes<br></li><li>50+ Battle Encounters<br></li><li>30+ Mysterious Encounters<br></li><li>7 Maps</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1687740?t=1666378010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1666378010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1666378010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1666378010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play it your way, each hero has 3 different card categories, attack, defense, and utility. You can put together the combinations that best suit your play style.<br><br>Each category also has its own relics, which can further enhance your gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Rune System</h2>Enhance your deck with an advanced rune system that adds unique talents to your cards. This allows the deck construction to have endless possibilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Corruption</h2>The world is in a constant fight against corruption, which grows stronger as the days go by and applies disease to your world. These diseases directly interfere with combat and game difficulty, since the number of diseases increases with each full moon (7 days).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day &amp; Night Cycle</h2>Create strategies and prepare for the night in the midst of battle. At dusk, monsters of the night appear and black portals are opened. Get exclusive rewards if you win a night battle! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" width=616 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather Events</h2>Rains, sandstorms, blizzards. Some events can benefit you, but others can end your battle, be aware and use them to your advantage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" width=616 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>150+ Cards<br></li><li>70+ Relics<br></li><li>30+ Runes<br></li><li>50+ Battle Encounters<br></li><li>30+ Mysterious Encounters<br></li><li>7 Maps</li></ul>","developers":["Pyxeralia LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/header.jpg?t=1666378010","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 Pyxeralia","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687740/382841/0d9f2deb630ef5aded8cad7118fc2c06de682303/1751019735/dash_av1.mpd?t=1625763781","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687740/382841/0d9f2deb630ef5aded8cad7118fc2c06de682303/1751019735/dash_h264.mpd?t=1625763781","highlight":true,"hls_h264":